      "source": [
        "# Copenhagen Housing Price Model\n",
        "\n",
        "Hierarchical Bayesian model of residential sqm prices across 9 Copenhagen districts (1992–2024), with a 2026–2060 forecast driven by Statistics Denmark population projections.\n",
        "\n",
        "**Data sources**\n",
        "- Housing transactions: [Kaggle – Danish Residential Housing Prices 1992–2024](https://www.kaggle.com/datasets/martinfrederiksen/danish-residential-housing-prices-1992-2024)\n",
        "- Socioeconomic panel: Statistics Denmark (KKBEF2, KKLEDIG6, KKIND3, KKHUS1, KKFR2026)"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "id": "3cae2601",
