            "\n",
            "======================================================================\n",
            "FEATURE INDEPENDENCE / MULTICOLLINEARITY SUMMARY\n",
            "======================================================================\n",
            "Maximum absolute pairwise correlation: 0.75\n",
            "Maximum VIF: 6.55\n",
            "Condition number: 6.00\n",
            "\n",
            "Conclusion:\n",
            "Some dependence between engineered features may be present.\n",
